From 249cef2b03432609ccd0106161a827a317f9e252 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angus Turnbull <github@twinhelix.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 03:28:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in message retention controls

Adapt fc0daac37774d9c20238a34ac4786d9398adc07f with AI-assisted compatibility changes. Media deletion is credited to johanw in the source. Keep privacy defaults disabled, preserve linked-device deletion and expiry configuration, and avoid overwriting user reactions.

